<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Income Sources | 8-Tier Base Production Guide" description="Maximize cash yields in Sell Lemons. Explore the 8-tier base production hierarchy (Lemon Stand to Space LemonX) and discover optimal manager automation priorities.">
  <main>
    <!-- Page Hero Section -->
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Income & Buildings</p>
          <h1>The Ultimate Sell Lemons Income Bible</h1>
          <p>Learn how all 8 income tiers stack together, how to bypass decoration-gated blocks, and the optimal recruitment sequence for automation managers.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons income sources guide" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Guide Body -->
    <article class="guide-detail">
      <h2>The 8-Tier Sell Lemons Income Progression</h2>
      
      <aside class="income-rule-box" style="background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <strong style="color: var(--accent-color); font-size: 1.1rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">💡 The Compounding Rule: Lower Tiers Matter!</strong>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);">
          In Sell Lemons, higher tiers do not replace your old ones—they multiply them! Even when you reach the endgame, your starting Lemon Stand and LemonDash delivery system provide the crucial base income that late-game space stations multiply. Never leave your early-game buildings empty. Upgrading everything together yields the fastest scaling.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>🟢 Early Game: Startup Industry</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Tier 1: Lemon Stand (The Starter Stand)</strong> — Click to sell lemons for $1, collect loose cash spawning on the floor, and upgrade Juicers ($450) and Cash Registers ($2,100) immediately to automate early clicks.</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 2: LemonDash (Logistics Delivery)</strong> — Deliver juice orders using vehicles. Upgrade Delivery Fees and Vehicle Speed. Always use counter-offers (25%-35% markup) to boost payouts.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>🔵 Mid Game: Factory & Stock Trading</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Tier 3: Lemon Depot (Bulk Factory)</strong> — Processes bulk orders for millions. Beware of decoration gates: buy the Depot Roof and walls to spawn hidden upgrade buttons.</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 4: Lemon Trading (Futures Market)</strong> — Buy low and sell high. High risk; market crashes can wipe out your wallet. Keep 50% cash reserves until you hire the Trading Manager for safety.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>🟣 Late Game to Endgame: Infinite Scaling</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Tier 5: Lemon Labs (Research)</strong> — Unlocks massive multipliers that survive Rebirth resets. Explore all floors after big upgrades to find hidden buttons.</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 6: Lemon Robotics (Tick Automators)</strong> — Robotic arms that automate click routines. At Evolution 60+, dump your starting cash here to fund all lower tiers instantly.</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 7: Lemon Republic (Sovereign Power)</strong> — Business becomes a nation-state. Unlocks massive global multipliers affecting all 6 previous tiers simultaneously. Maximize sovereignty before returning to Labs.</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 8: LemonX (Cosmic Zone)</strong> — Space lemon harvesting on the extraterrestrial map. Complete the Good Samaritan event to get the UFO Key, allowing access to the cosmic zone and the Purity Fruit.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>🤖 Manager Recruitment Sequence</h3>
          <p>Deploy your capital efficiently by hiring automation managers in this order:</p>
          <ol style="margin-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li><strong>Stand Automator (Tier 1):</strong> Crucial early game purchase to eliminate click strain.</li>
            <li><strong>LemonDash Manager (Tier 2):</strong> Buy only after upgrading delivery fees and speed.</li>
            <li><strong>Depot Manager (Tier 3):</strong> Hire only after unlocking major depot multiplier upgrades.</li>
            <li><strong>Trading/Robotics Managers (Endgame):</strong> Secure once your capital is stable and global multipliers are active.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- What to Do Next Section -->
      <section class="guide-what-next" aria-labelledby="guide-what-next-title">
        <header class="guide-what-next__head">
          <span class="guide-what-next__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔑</span>
          <h2 id="guide-what-next-title">What to Do Next</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="guide-what-next__divider" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__diamond"></span>
          <span></span>
        </div>
        <a class="guide-what-next__cta" href="/deals/">
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">🔑</span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-copy">
            <strong>👉 Discover Map Secrets</strong>
            <span>Solve the sewer mazes, get the UFO key, and unlock hidden endgame areas.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="income-sources" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
